        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.7(d) Hiring of Employees on Part-Time Work Schedule. The Company will not hire new employees into the bargaining unit on part-time work schedules and will not normally approve part-time work schedules for employees with less than two (2) years of Company service; provided, however, that the Company may retire retirees on part-time schedules. Approval of part-time work schedules may be revoked at any time at management's discretion.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
